  fishName: Handfish
  description: An utterly puzzling creature, considered by some to be proof of the
    existance of a divine creator, and by others to be proof of the opposite. In
    any case, it's large hands allow it to climb up and down the steep slopes of
    its volcanic home.\n\n  Chef's Notes:\nWhat a strange creature... Its meat is
    tender and delicious, but I really do hate looking at the thing while I prepare
    it.
